ked","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காக்கை","parts":[{"text":"காக்கை","lemma":"காக்கை","gloss":"crow"}],"gloss":"crow"},{"surface":"கூகையடு","parts":[{"text":"கூகையடு","lemma":"கூகையடு","gloss":"with the owl"}],"gloss":"with the owl","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கூடிப்","parts":[{"text":"கூடு","lemma":"கூடு","gloss":"to gather"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"},{"text":"ப்","lemma":"ப்","gloss":"hard consonant doubler"}],"gloss":"having gathered"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பகலும்","parts":[{"text":"பகல்","lemma":"பகல்","gloss":"daytime"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even in daytime"},{"surface":"கூவும்","parts":[{"text":"கூவு","lemma":"கூவு","gloss":"to screech"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"which"}],"gloss":"screeching"},{"surface":"அகலுள்","parts":[{"text":"அகல்","lemma":"அகல்","gloss":"wide"},{"text":"உள்","lemma":"உள்","gloss":"inside"}],"gloss":"wide space"},{"surface":"ஆங்கண்","parts":[{"text":"ஆங்கண்","lemma":"ஆங்கண்","gloss":"in that place"}],"gloss":"in that place","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"காடுகண்","parts":[{"text":"காடு","lemma":"காடு","gloss":"cremation ground"},{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"place"}],"gloss":"in the cremation ground"},{"surface":"மறைத்த","parts":[{"text":"மறை","lemma":"மறை","gloss":"to hide"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"hidden"},{"surface":"கல்லென்","parts":[{"text":"கல்லென்","lemma":"கல்லென்","gloss":"noisy"}],"gloss":"noisy","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சுற்றமொடு","parts":[{"text":"சுற்றம்","lemma":"சுற்றம்","gloss":"relatives"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with relatives"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இல்என்று","parts":[{"text":"இல்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"house/nothing"},{"text":"என்று","lemma":"என்று","gloss":"saying"}],"gloss":"saying 'he is no more'"},{"surface":"இல்வயின்","parts":[{"text":"இல்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"house"},{"text":"வயின்","lemma":"வயின்","gloss":"towards"}],"gloss":"towards the house"},{"surface":"பெயர","parts":[{"text":"பெயர்","lemma":"பெயர்","gloss":"to return"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"as they return"}],"gloss":"as they return"},{"surface":"மெல்ல","parts":[{"text":"மெல்ல","lemma":"மெல்ல","gloss":"slowly"}],"gloss":"slowly"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இடஞ்சிறிது","parts":[{"text":"இடம்","lemma":"இடம்","gloss":"space"},{"text":"சிறிது","lemma":"சிறிது","gloss":"small"}],"gloss":"small space"},{"surface":"ஒதுங்கல்","parts":[{"text":"ஒதுங்கு","lemma":"ஒதுங்கு","gloss":"to shrink/step aside"},{"text":"அல்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"verbal noun suffix"}],"gloss":"shrinking/stepping aside"},{"surface":"அஞ்சி","parts":[{"text":"அஞ்சு","lemma":"அஞ்சு","gloss":"to fear"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"fearing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உடம்பொடும்","parts":[{"text":"உடம்பு","lemma":"உடம்பு","gloss":"body"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even with the body"},{"surface":"சென்மார்","parts":[{"text":"சென்மார்","lemma":"சென்மார்","gloss":"they will go"}],"gloss":"they will go","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உயர்ந்தோர்","parts":[{"text":"உயர்","lemma":"உயர்","gloss":"to rise/be noble"},{"text":"ந்","lemma":"ந்","gloss":"glide"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ஓர்","gloss":"pronominal suffix"}],"gloss":"of the noble ones"},{"surface":"நாட்டே","parts":[{"text":"நாட்டே","lemma":"நாட்டே","gloss":"to the land"}],"gloss":"to the land","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"Like the sun, beautiful gems interwoven / moon-resembling pearl necklace on the chest rolling / receiving offerings drum in the battle camp roaring / across the land spread great deeds warriors / desiring battle raising victorious white flag / terrifying form like having hosts army / of death like irresistible strong man / bellowing of cows if seen sages / four Vedas is not intended because of not being merciful / intended righteousness is not because of becoming wealth / delusion having cleared confusion having removed / poured by hand water like the expanse of the sea / suitable which was leaf/food having granted / cooked rice having given and very greatly / abundantly excellent fine ornaments having distributed very well / small white bones in the vast white saline wasteland / strong-beaked crow with the owl having gathered / even in daytime screeching wide space in that place / in the cremation ground hidden noisy with relatives / saying 'he is no more' towards the house as they return slowly / small space shrinking/stepping aside fearing / even with the body they will go of the noble ones to the land","translation":"With beautiful gems interwoven like the sun and a pearl necklace resembling the moon rolling on his chest, while the sacrificial drum roars in the battle camp, the warriors who spread across the land performing great deeds raise the victorious white flag of battle. With an army like a host of terrifying deities, he is an irresistible strong man like the god of death. When sages who study the four Vedas see the bellowing cows captured in raid, they know that the Vedas do not advocate lack of mercy, nor do they advocate righteousness merely for the sake of wealth. Therefore, clearing all delusion and removing confusion, he pours water like the vast expanse of the sea, grants suitable food, gives cooked rice, and generously distributes fine ornaments of great excellence. Yet, in the vast white saline wasteland filled with small white bones, where the strong-beaked crow and the owl gather to screech even during the day, his noisy relatives, after hiding him in the cremation ground, return slowly to the house saying 'he is no more'. Fearing to step aside even slightly, they will depart with their bodies to the land of the noble ones.","modern":"சூரியனைப் போன்ற அழகிய மணிகள் பதிக்கப்பட்ட, சந்திரனைப் போன்ற முத்துமாலை மார்பில் புரள, பலி பெறும் முரசு பாசறையில் முழங்க, உலகெங்கும் பரவிய பெருமைமிக்க வீரர்கள் போரை விரும்பி வெற்றிக் கொடியை உயர்த்துகின்றனர். அணங்கு போன்ற அச்சம் தரும் சேனைகளைக் கொண்ட, கூற்றுவனைப் போன்ற வலிமைமிக்க தலைவன் அவன். பசுக்களின் குரலைக் கேட்டு வரும் அந்தணர்கள், அருளற்ற செயல்களை நான்மறைகள் கூறவில்லை என்றும், அறம் என்பது பொருள் ஈட்டுவதற்காக மட்டும் அன்று என்றும் உணர்கின்றனர். மயக்கம் நீங்கி, தெளிவு பெற்று, கடல் பரப்பு போன்ற நீரை வார்த்து, தகுந்த உணவையும் சோற்றையும் வழங்கி, சிறந்த அணிகலன்களை வாரி வழங்குகிறான். ஆனால், சிறிய வெண்மையான எலும்புகள் கிடக்கும் பெரிய களர் நிலத்தில், காக்கையும் கூகையும் கூடிப் பகலிலும் அலறும் சுடுகாட்டில், அவனது உடலை மறைத்துவிட்டு, சுற்றத்தார் 'அவன் இல்லை' என்று கூறிவிட்டு மெல்ல வீடு திரும்புகின்றனர். எனவே, இவ்வுலகில் சிறிதும் ஒதுங்கி வாழ அஞ்சி, சான்றோர்கள் உடம்போடு உயர்ந்தோர் உலகிற்குச் செல்வர்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Puram genre, specifically under the theme of Peruṅkāñci (the great transience of life) in Potuviyal tiṇai. The poet, Ciṟuveṇṭēraiyār, addresses the transience of human life and the ultimate futility of material wealth and power. He describes a mighty king who possesses a terrifying army, wears brilliant gems and pearl necklaces, and generously distributes wealth, food, and ornaments to sages and the needy. However, despite his immense power and generosity, his life ends in the cremation ground, a desolate saline wasteland where crows and owls screech even during the day. His relatives perform his final rites, leave him behind, and return home saying 'he is no more.' The poet concludes that realizing this transience, noble ones fear to waste their lives in trivial pursuits and instead strive to reach the heavenly land of the virtuous even while in their physical bodies by performing righteous deeds.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.88],[1.0,1.5],[1.5,1.8],[1.8,2.4],[2.4,2.8],[2.8,3.2],[3.2,3.95],[3.95,4.7],[4.